<title>USA: TABLE - Marsh Supermarkets sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Marsh Supermarkets sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue</p>
<p>from Marsh Supermarkets Inc was priced Tuesday via lead manger</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Marsh operates 89 supermarkets and 182 convenience stores in</p>
<p>Indiana and western Ohio.</p>
<p>BORROWER MARSH SUPERMARKETS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.185  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.00 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD +289 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
